              "The announcement, which came from the Office of the U.S. Trade Representative, ensures that Apple products and other major consumer goods would be shielded from the import tax until at least December, potentially keeping costs on these products down during the holiday shopping season.\npixel",
              "{\"headline\":\"Trump delays some China tariffs to limit impact on holiday shopping\",\"alternativeHeadline\":\"Trump delays some China tariffs to limit impact on holiday shopping\",\"dateModified\":\"2019-08-14T20:24:28.005Z\",\"datePublished\":\"2019-08-13T14:11:54.000Z\",\"author\":[{\"name\":\"Damian Paletta\"},{\"name\":\"Heather Long\"}],\"isPartOf\":{\"name\":\"The Washington Post\",\"productID\":\"washingtonpost.com:basic\",\"description\":\"Breaking news and analysis on politics, business, world, national news, entertainment and more. In-depth DC, Virginia, Maryland news coverage including traffic, weather, crime, education, restaurant reviews and more.\",\"sku\":\"https://subscribe.washingtonpost.com\",\"brand\":{\"name\":\"The Washington Post\"}},\"publisher\":{\"name\":\"The Washington Post\"},\"isAccessibleForFree\":false,\"hasPart\":{\"isAccessibleForFree\":false},\"keywords\":\"business\"}"
